 "remarks": "Move right into this bright and inviting 1-bedroom ranch-style end unit in the heart of Springdale! Ideally positioned at the end of the building, this home features additional windows and an abundance of natural light. Freshly painted throughout, with hardwood floors in the main living area and brand-new carpet in the bedroom. The spacious living/dining area provides plenty of room to relax or entertain, while the kitchen is equipped with a stainless-steel refrigerator, stove and dishwasher. The generously sized primary bedroom features a walk-in closet. Enjoy morning coffee or unwind outside on the shared deck, with this unit ideally situated at the end for added privacy. Additional highlights include a private storage room with your own washer/dryer and one-car garage parking and additional 1 reserved parking spot. Pet-friendly complex. Conveniently located within walking distance to shops, restaurants, the park, library and more, with easy access to the Merritt Parkway for commuting.",
